model {
  extend basalt.poolRuntime {
    metadata {
      constraint "Home returns an opt-in two-element RPOP envelope containing the unchanged primary reply followed by at most four closed, bounded stage timings. Reply-write duration measures the real primary transport before its trailer. Required accounting fencing and local close precede diagnostic work on primary write failure; an incomplete trailer also fences accounted admission. Legacy requests retain their exact reply and no dispatch is replayed."
    }
  }
}
